  "details": "I noticed that there's no visual notification for some important things like chatboxes, making it hard to know if someone behind us is trying to communicate with us.\n\nD/deaf users like me, especially when we don't have an artificial ear on, will not sense the notification sounds.\n\nA little chat symbol beside the mic icon, or a direction indicator to let us know where to look should be working options.",
